<title>UK: NWE high sulphur straight-run fuel stable.</title>
<headline>NWE high sulphur straight-run fuel stable.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>NWE high sulphur straight-run fuel oil prices were seen stable on Monday despite rising crude oil futures, traders said.</p>
<p>An ARA player bought on Friday an E-4 cargo at around $3.50 over the mean/mean/mean.</p>
<p>Other E-4 cargoes were seen available out of Klaipeda and Ventspils, as well as an M-40 and an M-100.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8167</p>
</text>
